.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rsop-verify 1 "February 2025" "rsop 0.11.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
rsop\-verify \- Verifies Detached Signatures
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBrsop verify\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-not\-before\fR] [\fB\-\-not\-after\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISIGNATURES\fR> [\fICERTS\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Verifies Detached Signatures
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-not\-before\fR \fI<NOT_BEFORE>\fR
Consider signatures before this date invalid
.TP
\fB\-\-not\-after\fR \fI<NOT_AFTER>\fR
Consider signatures after this date invalid
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISIGNATURES\fR>
Signatures to verify
.TP
[\fICERTS\fR]
Certs for verification
